{
 "id": "seg6",
 "title": "写进流水线",
 "pill": 6,
 "total": 54.86,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg6-00",
   "text": "最后，按角色各做一件事。",
   "spoken": "最后，按决色各做一件事。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg6-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.48,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 3.838
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-01",
   "text": "先对照八个关口问一句，哪一个是你们跳过的？",
   "spoken": "先对照八个关口问一句，哪一个是你们跳过的？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg6-01.wav",
   "start": 4.3,
   "dur": 4.08,
   "speechStart": 4.3,
   "speechEnd": 8.162
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-02",
   "text": "开发者，今天就给你的核心合约，写下一条不变量，让测试去检查它。",
   "spoken": "开发者，今天就给你的核心合约，写下一条不变量，让测试去检查它。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg6-02.wav",
   "start": 8.88,
   "dur": 5.52,
   "speechStart": 8.976,
   "speechEnd": 14.238
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-03",
   "text": "做审计和评审的人，核对审计版本的提交哈希，和线上字节码是不是同一份。",
   "spoken": "做审计和评审的人，核对审计版本的提交哈希，和线上字节码是不是同一份。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg6-03.wav",
   "start": 14.62,
   "dur": 6.4,
   "speechStart": 14.62,
   "speechEnd": 20.789
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-04",
   "text": "项目负责人，回答一个问题，如果今晚出事，谁有权按下暂停，他自己知道吗？",
   "spoken": "项目负责人，回答一个问题，如果今晚出事，谁有权按下暂停，他自己知道吗？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg6-04.wav",
   "start": 21.24,
   "dur": 6.4,
   "speechStart": 21.24,
   "speechEnd": 27.456
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-05",
   "text": "回到开头的问题。",
   "spoken": "回到开头的问题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg6-05.wav",
   "start": 28.14,
   "dur": 1.36,
   "speechStart": 28.14,
   "speechEnd": 29.321
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-06",
   "text": "项目方能用我们通过了审计，证明线上代码安全吗？",
   "spoken": "项目方能用我们通过了审计，证明线上代码安全吗？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg6-06.wav",
   "start": 29.72,
   "dur": 3.92,
   "speechStart": 29.81,
   "speechEnd": 33.478
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-07",
   "text": "不能。",
   "spoken": "不能。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg6-07.wav",
   "start": 34.14,
   "dur": 0.72,
   "speechStart": 34.249,
   "speechEnd": 34.605
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-08",
   "text": "审计结论，只对审计时的那个提交哈希成立。",
   "spoken": "审计结论，只对审计时的那个提交哈希成立。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg6-08.wav",
   "start": 35.08,
   "dur": 3.68,
   "speechStart": 35.08,
   "speechEnd": 38.592
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-09",
   "text": "还要证明线上字节码等于审计版本，并且上线后的每一次改动，都经过审查。",
   "spoken": "还要证明线上字节码等于审计版本，并且上线后的每一次改动，都经过审查。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg6-09.wav",
   "start": 38.98,
   "dur": 7.28,
   "speechStart": 38.98,
   "speechEnd": 46.072
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-10",
   "text": "审计是流水线上的一个关口，不是一张免检证书。",
   "spoken": "审计是流水线上的一个关口，不是一张免检证书。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg6-10.wav",
   "start": 46.48,
   "dur": 4.56,
   "speechStart": 46.48,
   "speechEnd": 50.796
  },
